        {
          "text": "Amajambo yawe yarabonetse, ndayarya; kand’ amajambo yawe yambereye akanyamuneza n’ibihimbaro vy’umutima wanje: kuko nitiriwe izina ryawe, Uhoraho Mana Nyen’ ingabo. ",
