          "text": "Kandi mur’ ubu bgoko nzoguhindura uruzitiro rukomeye rw’imiringa; bazokurwanya, ariko ntibazokunesha, kuko nzoba ndi kumwe nawe ngo ngukize, nkurokore, ni jewe Uhoraho mbivuze. ",
